oth directions), and it asserts positively that the C side really was killed by signal 13 so it can't silently degrade into \"both exited 0\". The `/dev/full` and `script(1)` tests fall back to asserting the ordinary differential case rather than passing vacuously if those facilities are missing.\n\nMismatch and rationale are recorded in `translation/ERRORS.md`.","ttft_ms":2791,"ttft_stream_ms":2631,"time_to_request_ms":43,"type":"result","duration_ms":496723,"uuid":"843be46c-f1d9-4738-9c10-31f85ac20db8","queued_turn_count":0}
